      "type": "table",
      "title": "Run log",
      "description": "One row per invocation, including every one that changed nothing.\n\n`rotated` true means the run saw a rotated trail, so its window is short by however much rotation dropped — worth knowing before trusting that run's support counts. `replayChanged` is how many of the real recorded decisions a candidate would have flipped; a candidate that flips a decision a human reversed is auto-rejected and never reaches you.",
